              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दुश्मन की सेना ने क़िले को घेर लिया। duśman kī senā ne qile ko gher liyā. The enemy army laid siege to the fort."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने गाँव को घेरा, usne gā̃v ko gherā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घेरना (ghernā) is inherited from ghir, \"go round\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 4474): to go all the way round something and close it in."
            }
          ]
        },
